    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" caput="8" para="true">CAP. VIII.</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="1" caput="8">Clavis figi solitos, interdum funibus</l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="1" caput="8">adstringi.</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">SEd jam ad <i>Astrictionem</i> trans-</l>
    <l n="5">eo; quæ facta clavis, aut fu-</l>
    <l n="6">nibus, sed plurimùm illis. Sene-</l>
    <l n="7">ca : <i>Cùm refigere se crucibus co-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>nentur, in quas unusquisque ve-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>strum clavos suos ipse adigit.</i> Ita le-</l>
    <l n="10">gendum, <i>non adjicit.</i> Illi, inquit,</l>
    <l n="11">conantur tollere se de crucibus</l>
    <l n="12">suis: vos contrà, magis magisque</l>
    <l n="13">affigitis, &amp; clavos adigitis in li-</l>
    <l n="14">gnum. Meminit &amp; Apollo in</l>
    <l n="15">oraculo quopiam, de Christo:</l>
